OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with some rain,
OL,6,Fbut brighter drier weather soon
OL,7,Freaching Argyll will extend to all
OL,8,Fareas by afternoon, with some
OL,9,Fsunshine. The odd shower is possible
OL,10,Facross Argyll.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening with
OL,13,Fsome sunshine. The rest of the night
OL,14,Fwill then remain dry for most with
OL,15,Fclear spells, perhaps just the odd
OL,16,Flight shower for Argyll.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FA mainly dry, bright day with
OL,19,Fplenty of warm sunny spells. Sunshine
OL,20,Fwill turn a little hazy at times
OL,21,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
